tooltips_seen = PackedStringArray("Buy a pack of cabbages at the ticker price, paid from your coins. They roll down the chute. From 130 cabbages in stock, a pack costs 5× as much.", "Your memos: the ones you have earned and the ones still classified, with how to earn them. Click to open.", "Approval press. Drag a card from the tray onto the pad, then pull this handle all the way down to pay for and approve it.", "Your price per cabbage. Click \"<\" or \">\" to change it by $1. Higher pays more per sale, but the street refuses more cabbages.", "Raise your price by $1. Each cabbage earns more, but above what the street accepts, more get refused.", "Lower your price by $1. Fewer cabbages get refused, but each one earns less.", "Play or stop the radio.", "Skip to the next song.", "Approved cards. Click to read every card you have bought.", "Coins: the money you have. Prices in $ (cards, upgrades, packs) are paid from here. Coins on the mat only count once you sweep them in.", "Findings (¶): research points from the QA bay. Cards priced in ¶ are paid from here. Tokens on the desk only count once you sweep them in.", "Acceptance meter: how likely the street buys a cabbage at your price right now. Left is never, right is always.", "Pull down to open the projector: the upgrade tree. Hold an upgrade there to buy it with coins.", "Pricing consultant switch. Up: it keeps nudging your price toward where about 90% of units sell. Down: it stays away.", "Tube lever. SALES: minis roll out of the window and sell. RESEARCH: they go to the QA lab for Findings. SPLIT: every other one. Drag it, or click to step.", "The ledger: your sales, coins over time, staff and approvals. Click to open.", "Coin robot: it collects the coins resting on the mat. If it falls over, pick it up and set it down.", "Pricing consultant switch. Up: it keeps moving your price to where about 90% of cabbages sell (or as far above that as you set it). Down: it stays away.", "TV remote. Click: watch the farm feed on the set beside the desk. The arrow, Esc or a click beside the screen: back to the desk.", "Auto-buy lamp: amber while on. Click it (or the switch beside it) to turn automatic pack buying on or off.", "Auto-buy switch. Up: a pack is bought by itself whenever stock runs low (and you can pay). Down: you buy by hand.", "Tube lever. SALES: minis roll out of the window and sell. RESEARCH: they go to the research lab for Findings. SPLIT: every other one. Drag it, or click to step.", "Findings (¶): research points from the research lab. Cards priced in ¶ are paid from here. Tokens on the desk only count once you sweep them in.")
